{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-luk-1-intro","title":"Luke 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>40; 16:1; Mt 27:61; 28:1; Lu 23:55,56; 24:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-1","title":"Luke 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The preface of Luke to his whole gospel. 5 The conception of John the Baptist; 26 and of Christ. 39 The prophecy of Elisabeth and of Mary, concerning Christ. 57 The nativity and circumcision of John. 67 The prophecy of Zacharias, both of Christ, 76 and of John.</p>\n<p>those. Joh 20:31; Ac 1:1-3; 1Ti 3:16; 2Pe 1:16-19 most surely.[Peplerophoremenon,] the passive participle of [plerophoreo ,] from [pleres phora,] full measure; and is applied to a ship fully laden, to a tree in full bearing, etc. Hence it implies that fulness of evidence by which any fact is supported, and also that confidence, or feeling of assent, by which facts so supported are believed.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-2","title":"Luke 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>which. 24:48; Mr 1:1; Joh 15:27; Ac 1:3,8,21,22; 4:20; 10:39-41; Heb 2:3 1Pe 5:1; 1Jo 1:1-3 and. Ac 26:16; Ro 15:16; Eph 3:7,8; 4:11,12; Col 1:23-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-3","title":"Luke 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>seemed. Ac 15:19,25,28; 1Co 7:40; 16:12 in. 1; Ps 40:5; 50:21; Ec 12:9; Ac 11:4 most. Ac 1:1; 23:26; 24:3; 26:25; *Gr:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-4","title":"Luke 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>Joh 20:31; 2Pe 1:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-5","title":"Luke 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Herod. Mt 2:1 of the course. 1Ch 24:10,19; Ne 12:4,17 Abijah.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-6","title":"Luke 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>righteous. 16:15; Ge 6:9; 7:1; 17:1; Job 1:1,8; 9:2; Ro 3:9-25; Php 3:6-9 Tit 3:3-7 walking. 1Ki 9:4; 2Ki 20:3; Ps 119:6; Ac 23:1; 24:16; 1Co 11:2; 2Co 1:12 Php 3:6; Tit 2:11-14; 1Jo 2:3,29; 3:7 blameless. Php 2:15; Col 1:22; 1Th 3:13; 2Pe 3:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-7","title":"Luke 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>they had. Ge 15:2,3; 16:1,2; 25:21; 30:1; Jud 13:2,3; 1Sa 1:2,5-8 well. Ge 17:17; 18:11; 1Ki 1:1; 2Ki 4:14; Ro 4:19; Heb 11:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-8","title":"Luke 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>he. Ex 28:1,41; 29:1,9,44; 30:30; Nu 18:7; 1Ch 24:2; 2Ch 11:14 in. 5; 1Ch 24:19; 2Ch 8:14; 31:2,19; Ezr 6:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-9","title":"Luke 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>his. Ex 30:7,8; 37:25-29; Nu 16:40; 1Sa 2:28; 1Ch 6:49; 23:13; 2Ch 26:16 2Ch 29:11; Heb 9:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-10","title":"Luke 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Le 16:17; Heb 4:14; 9:24; Re 8:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-11","title":"Luke 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>appeared. 19,28; 2:10; Jud 13:3,9; Ac 10:3,4; Heb 1:14 the altar. Ex 30:1-6; 37:25-29; 40:26,27; Le 16:13; Re 8:3,4; 9:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-12","title":"Luke 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>he. 29; 2:9,10; Jud 6:22; 13:22; Job 4:14,15; Da 10:7; Mr 16:5; Ac 10:4 Re 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-13","title":"Luke 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Fear. 24:36-40; Jud 6:23; Da 10:12; Mt 28:5; Mr 16:6 thy prayer. Ge 25:21; 1Sa 1:20-23; Ps 118:21; Ac 10:31 and they. Ge 17:10; 18:14; Jud 13:3-5; 1Sa 2:21; 2Ki 4:16,17; Ps 113:9 Ps 127:3-5 thou. 60-63; 2:21; Ge 17:19; Isa 8:3; Ho 1:4,6,9,10; Mt 1:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-14","title":"Luke 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>58; Ge 21:6; Pr 15:20; 23:15,24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-15","title":"Luke 1:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>great. 7:28; Ge 12:2; 48:19; Jos 3:7; 4:14; 1Ch 17:8; 29:12; Mt 11:9-19 Joh 5:35 and shall. 7:33; Nu 6:2-4; Jud 13:4-6; Mt 11:18 filled. Zec 9:15; Ac 2:4,14-18; Eph 5:18 even. Ps 22:9; Jer 1:5; Ga 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-16","title":"Luke 1:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>76; Isa 40:3-5; 49:6; Da 12:3; Mal 3:1; Mt 3:1-6; 21:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-17","title":"Luke 1:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>before. 16; Joh 1:13,23-30,34; 3:28 in. Mal 4:5,6; Mt 11:14; 17:11,12; Mr 9:11-13; Joh 1:21-24; Re 20:4 power. 1Ki 17:1; 18:18; 21:20; 2Ki 1:4-6,16 Elijah. Mt 3:4,7-12; 14:4 turn. 3:7-14; Mal 4:6 and the. Isa 29:24; Mt 21:29-32; 1Co 6:9-11 to. or, by. to make. 1Sa 7:5; 1Ch 29:18; 2Ch 29:36; Ps 10:17;