,25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-32","title":"Luke 1:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>shall be great. 15; 3:16; Mt 3:11; 12:42; Php 2:9-11 the Son. 35; Mr 5:7; 14:61; Joh 6:69; Ac 16:17; Ro 1:4; Heb 1:2-8 give. 2Sa 7:11-13; Ps 132:11; Isa 9:6,7; 16:5; Jer 23:5,6; 33:15-17 Eze 17:22-24; 34:23,24; 37:24,25; Am 9:11,12; Mt 28:18; Joh 3:35,36 Joh 5:21-29; 12:34; Ac 2:30,36; Eph 1:20-23; Re 3:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-33","title":"Luke 1:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>he. Ps 45:6; 89:35-37; Da 2:44; 7:13,14,27; Ob 1:21; Mic 4:7; 1Co 15:24,25 Heb 1:8; Re 11:15; 20:4-6; 22:3-5 the. Ro 9:6; Ga 3:29; 6:16; Php 3:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-34","title":"Luke 1:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>Jud 13:8-12; Ac 9:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-35","title":"Luke 1:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>The Holy Ghost. 27,31; Mt 1:20 that. Job 14:4; 15:16; 25:4; Ps 51:5; Eph 2:3; Heb 4:15; 7:26-28 the Son of God. 32; Ps 2:7; Mt 14:33; 26:63,64; 27:54; Mr 1:1; Joh 1:34,49; 20:31 Ac 8:37; Ro 1:4; Ga 2:20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-36","title":"Luke 1:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>24-26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-37","title":"Luke 1:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>with. 18:27; Ge 18:14; Nu 11:23; Job 13:2; Jer 32:17,27; Zec 8:6; Mt 19:26 Mr 10:27; Php 3:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-38","title":"Luke 1:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>Behold. 2Sa 7:25-29; Ps 116:16; Ro 4:20,21 be. Ps 119:38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-39","title":"Luke 1:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>into. Jos 10:40; 15:48-59; 21:9-11 city.This was most probably Hebron, a city of the priests, and situated in the hill country of Judea, (Jos 11:21; 21:11, 13,) about 25 miles south of Jerusalem, and nearly 100 from Nazareth. Such was the intense desire of Mary's mind to visit and communicate with her relative Elisabeth, that she scrupled not to undertake this long journey to effect her purpose.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-41","title":"Luke 1:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>the babe. 15,44; Ge 25:22; Ps 22:10 was. 67; 4:1; Ac 2:4; 4:8; 6:3; 7:55; Eph 5:18; Re 1:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-42","title":"Luke 1:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>Blessed art. 28,48; Jud 5:24 blessed is. 19:38; Ge 22:18; Ps 21:6; 45:2; 72:17-19; Ac 2:26-28; Ro 9:5 Heb 12:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-43","title":"Luke 1:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>whence. 7:7; Ru 2:10; 1Sa 25:41; Mt 3:14; Joh 13:5-8; Php 2:3 my. 20:42-44; Ps 110:1; Joh 13:13; 20:28; Php 3:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-44","title":"Luke 1:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>the babe. 41</p>"},{"id":"tsk-luk-1-45","title":"Luke 1:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"LUK","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>blessed. 20; 11:27,28; 2Ch 20:20; Joh 11:40; 20:29 that be